{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0614_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0e8afe52b35bc01b4d6f611691182b0fb28d10a4a89241a2632e8f8cd77d18e9", "ja": "（『アイドル水着大運動会』真っ最中！　瑞希は\n美奈子、紗代子と一緒に焼きそばを担当している）", "zh": "（《偶像泳装大运动会》正在如火如荼地进行！瑞希正和美奈子、纱代子一起负责炒面）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0614_1001_p", "source_sha256": "d83a8ee153e95344071680ce135809d04227be6e5d5c3f9951a8ddd1a841cea9", "ja": "（瑞希は、別件のグラビア撮影もこなしていた。\n現場が近いとはいえ、申し訳ないことをしたな……）", "zh": "（瑞希还完成了另一边的写真拍摄。虽然拍摄现场离这里很近，但还是给她添麻烦了，真是过意不去……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0614_1002_044miz", "source_sha256": "d9928eac5511a003e53bd00791326eac9959ae9095f3256e6f44ea211d0a2b60", "ja": "{$P$}。私はこの後も、\n焼きそばを作り続けて良いのでしょうか？", "zh": "{$P$}。我接下来也可以继续做炒面吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0614_1003_p", "source_sha256": "c4dba3b88b0a0620d58d54e520f042af8fcd9467da79a4e90fa59f54639747ba", "ja": "どうしたんだ、いきなり？", "zh": "怎么了，突然这是？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0614_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "25128b2266b00ed58a6e6ab4b9e9ef751529dd9e767f04e60324660c0df0a75f", "ja": "私には、佐竹さんほどの料理の腕はありませんし。\n高山さんほど、熱量のある接客もできません。", "zh": "我的厨艺没有佐竹小姐那么好。\n也做不到像高山小姐那样热情地招待客人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0614_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "316e3481337bb6d42b3d1e64f308396aa13912052da384e8357e21c06abd2c8c", "ja": "焼きそばの屋台という舞台において、あのふたりに\n勝てる気がしません。……ピンチだぞ、瑞希。", "zh": "在炒面摊这个舞台上，我感觉赢不了那两个人……大危机啊，瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0614_1006_p", "source_sha256": "3575ba1868360b8b45868fd9e9c6a7f50c84038ae7866819081e00c4af610eed", "ja": "そんな事はないと思うけどな……。\nそれにエキシビションマッチで、勝負じゃないんだし。", "zh": "我觉得没那回事吧……\n而且这是表演赛，又不是正式比赛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0614_1007_044miz", "source_sha256": "7d0cf0404524c6dd5933af967e0fee78a720811cdf6f8ecb1cdabb19d17e3327", "ja": "はい。ですが、今回は全員が出演するイベント。\n……目立たないと、埋もれる。", "zh": "是的。不过，这次是全员参加的活动。\n……不引人注目的话，就会被埋没。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0614_1008_p", "source_sha256": "fb2d7f7947ea003d89a084d4333f8a2d8e7ad77998128f9dd2229d4a3e3970e0", "ja": "本当にすまない……！　今日しか日程がなくてな。\n焼きそばを作るのが嫌なら、代わりに俺が……！", "zh": "真的很抱歉……！因为只有今天有空档。\n要是不想做炒面的话，就由我来代替你……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0614_1009_044miz", "source_sha256": "202315e81efc0bd66e9fc99ec70bba67aad43d2132f7b23243d0a1c44466d31a", "ja": "いけません、{$P$}。これは私の勝負\nです。……とはいえ、勝機を見いだせないのも事実。", "zh": "不行，{$P$}。这是属于我的决胜\n局。……话虽如此，找不到胜算也是事实。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0614_1010_p", "source_sha256": "048d836f22b093ff9c815891ea254686efc981021bd7137413f86590ee236e47", "ja": "なるほど。だとすると……あのふたりにはない、\n瑞希ならではの武器で勝負するしかないかもな。", "zh": "原来如此。这样的话……看来只能用瑞希独有的武器来一决胜负了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0614_1011_044miz", "source_sha256": "70f22bc5ba41488cbdc02c37526a740ea7ab093ae99700464cc661871c4b93e8", "ja": "私ならではの武器、ですか。\n……けど、焼きそばづくりで役に立つかどうか。", "zh": "属于我的独门武器吗。\n……不过，不知道对做炒面有没有帮助。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0614_1012_p", "source_sha256": "20c8b250740cacecaa437a8fe4bad3b2171c134946747cdb775dd8eda574c4d5", "ja": "難しく考えなくてもいいと思うよ。他のふたりより\n少しだけ得意だと思うことを考えればいいんだ。", "zh": "不用想得太复杂，我觉得没关系。想想看，\n有没有什么是你比另外两个人稍微擅长一点的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0614_1013_044miz", "source_sha256": "980b0ac0b11898335794d00774bf07dd0b40b1a2471ecc368c3557add5b78475", "ja": "なるほど。それなら……バトントワリングで\n焼きそばを……焼くのは少々難しそうです。むむむ。", "zh": "原来如此。这样的话……用花式转 baton\n来炒炒面……似乎有点困难。唔唔唔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0614_1014_044miz", "source_sha256": "f783dc3f0a0b2356cf02ac740b83c44b890dc430ff9827b8ca7e0f96ed1d674d", "ja": "クロスワードパズルで焼きそば……\nいえ、両手も視界も塞がってしまいますね。", "zh": "用填字游戏来做炒面……\n不行，双手和视线都会被占住呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0614_1015_044miz", "source_sha256": "bb84f1483bcf83e9999c99819001d5392fceecc22e1a30c51bb5e5d5a5a6f0ac", "ja": "あとは、手品ですが……。\n……焼きそばが焦げないか、心配だぞ。", "zh": "剩下的就是魔术了……\n……只是担心炒面会不会烤焦呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0614_1016_p", "source_sha256": "90b3e02ca7e165451f48f802208d91739ad9f9ce187989dc64f882131b54106f", "ja": "確かに。焼きそばが宙にでも浮けばいいけど。", "zh": "说得也是。要是炒面能飘在空中就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0614_1017_044miz", "source_sha256": "e6feb7318f2f0fc29dd16e2ab8f91da927123ef3810800f586d1e59eae77ce4d", "ja": "宙に浮く焼きそば？\n……なるほど。それは良いかもしれませんね。", "zh": "漂浮在空中的炒面？\n……原来如此。那说不定挺不错的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0614_1023_p", "source_sha256": "7549c62b474a7af5432b51e37d9e054714d674ebb08f1fdbd12cf2a6a0f81c35", "ja": "おっ、何か浮かんだのか？", "zh": "哦，有什么点子了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0614_1024_044miz", "source_sha256": "e2bcb689b7e18f07faaac3c1e0b583e160588c9ab2cea8112494fe73a3d83251", "ja": "はい。焼きそばを宙に浮かせたり、リトルミズキに\n焼いてもらうというのも良いかもしれません。", "zh": "是的。让炒面浮在空中，或者让小瑞希帮忙炒，也许也不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0614_1018_044miz", "source_sha256": "5df5da37661c48faefbd4044dd51b3b7f56bb85ba0140b8b6fa6f384c61e3e2a", "ja": "そして消えるヘラ。おお、なんということでしょう。\nアイディアが止まりません。……いけるぞ、瑞希。", "zh": "然后，铲子消失。哦，真是不得了。灵感根本停不下来……行得通，瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0614_1019_p", "source_sha256": "5daf2b24b8cd629cd147db6b38c0d55007267da437d7fd1e770a7679d90b781e", "ja": "流石だな！　きっとお客さんも、\n瑞希に注目してくれると思うよ。", "zh": "不愧是你！我想客人们一定也会把注意力放在瑞希身上的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0614_1020_044miz", "source_sha256": "5731f3961d8ed88b3d4c7c234e74b149957cbb0f823493bbca7a14444f6e11d2", "ja": "ありがとうございます、{$P$}。\nお任せください。", "zh": "谢谢您，{$P$}。\n请交给我吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0614_1021_044miz", "source_sha256": "a8a4a23a99e056fccfd6d55dbf633aa9691b8c69b23f3781479f2bde69a5be9e", "ja": "不肖、真壁瑞希。ここまでの勝負は、\nみなさんに活躍の場を譲っていましたが……。", "zh": "不肖真壁瑞希。到目前为止的较量，我一直把大显身手的机会让给大家，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0614_1022_044miz", "source_sha256": "eeef3420d8d30c13565b40696925e04000ff8e4ae1981d02cb26e9db703893a3", "ja": "ここから怒涛の快進撃をお見せしたいと思います。\n……勝利の美酒（ジュース）は美味いぜ、べいびー。", "zh": "接下来就请见证我势如破竹的强势反攻。\n……胜利的美酒（果汁）真好喝，宝贝。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
